version 0.14.0
footprint dc-in-th-dc-005-20a

description Approximate DC-005-20A land pattern; not fabrication-ready because the source drill syntax cannot encode the datasheet slots.
tags connector dc jack through-hole
attr through_hole
package_code DC-IN-TH-DC-005-20A
field Reference at=[0,-6.3] layer=F.SilkS size=[1,1] thickness=0.15 REF**
field Value at=[0,6.3] layer=F.Fab size=[1,1] thickness=0.15 dc-in-th-dc-005-20a

# Datasheet holes are 0.8x3.0mm for pads 1/2 and 0.8x2.5mm for pad 3.
# TextEDA source accepts only scalar drill diameters; drill=0.8 creates round holes and is not an exact or fabrication-ready slot representation.
# Pad centres follow the datasheet layout; oval copper-pad sizes follow the matching EasyEDA package model.
pads
  1  th  oval  [3,-2.325]   [1.5,3.8]  drill=0.8
  2  th  oval  [-3,-2.325]  [1.5,3.8]  drill=0.8
  3  th  oval  [0.5,2.325]  [1.5,3.4]  drill=0.8

graphics
  rect  F.CrtYd  [-7.55,-5,7.55,5]      width=0.05
  rect  F.Fab    [-7.05,-4.5,7.05,4.5]  width=0.1
  rect  F.SilkS  [-7.05,-4.5,7.05,4.5]  width=0.12
